    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/7c4ecb05a1ffb28a4b7ed909d4f4a2c9.poster.avif?t=1750129783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/7c4ecb05a1ffb28a4b7ed909d4f4a2c9.webm?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/7c4ecb05a1ffb28a4b7ed909d4f4a2c9.mp4?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>CLEARED HOT is a nostalgic helicopter shooter with satisfying physics and light tactical elements. Shoot, dodge, move your squad around the battlefield, and pick up almost anything with your rope and magnet.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/5e1c7dd2f9868fe124993015298238b1.poster.avif?t=1750129783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/5e1c7dd2f9868fe124993015298238b1.webm?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/5e1c7dd2f9868fe124993015298238b1.mp4?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>With fully physics-based action, you can get creative and use the environment to your advantage. Send enemies ragdolling through the air with your rockets, or use your rope to throw rocks at the enemy. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/2bed45953af5627c1a5ac09006023f43.poster.avif?t=1750129783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/2bed45953af5627c1a5ac09006023f43.webm?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/2bed45953af5627c1a5ac09006023f43.mp4?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The action is even hotter at night. Fly under the cover of darkness, and utilize your night vision or thermal goggles to get the jump on the enemy. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/20cfc9709a43a72547792d8131d0f964.poster.avif?t=1750129783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/20cfc9709a43a72547792d8131d0f964.webm?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/20cfc9709a43a72547792d8131d0f964.mp4?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Transport your squad to take enemy territory, or position them to defend your own base. Deploy them wisely to complete your objectives, and try not to drop too many along the way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/2c63223e23f0160c653ec36eb8803bb8.poster.avif?t=1750129783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/2c63223e23f0160c653ec36eb8803bb8.webm?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/2c63223e23f0160c653ec36eb8803bb8.mp4?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Haul a**\u2026and just about anything else. Redirect heat seeking missiles. Carry a tank to help you assault an enemy base. Pick up enemies and send them flying to their death. You can pick up anything that's not tied down, so get creative.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/e6b9fc99447e252f3ff0ff216d49bcca.avif?t=1750129783\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fully physics based. Pick up vehicles, enemies, or redirect heat seeking missiles. Discover emergent gameplay. <br></li><li> Full single player campaign <br></li><li> Buy and upgrade helicopters <br></li><li> Customizable loadouts<br></li><li> 3 biomes: Desert, Jungle, Arctic <br></li><li> Day and night missions<br></li><li> Wide range of physics based enemy vehicles: tanks, jeeps, technicals, anti-air turrets, boats, and fighter jets</li></ul><br><strong>Don't forget to wishlist and follow!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1750129783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/7c4ecb05a1ffb28a4b7ed909d4f4a2c9.poster.avif?t=1750129783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/7c4ecb05a1ffb28a4b7ed909d4f4a2c9.webm?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/7c4ecb05a1ffb28a4b7ed909d4f4a2c9.mp4?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>CLEARED HOT is a nostalgic helicopter shooter with satisfying physics and light tactical elements. Shoot, dodge, move your squad around the battlefield, and pick up almost anything with your rope and magnet.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/5e1c7dd2f9868fe124993015298238b1.poster.avif?t=1750129783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/5e1c7dd2f9868fe124993015298238b1.webm?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/5e1c7dd2f9868fe124993015298238b1.mp4?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>With fully physics-based action, you can get creative and use the environment to your advantage. Send enemies ragdolling through the air with your rockets, or use your rope to throw rocks at the enemy. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/2bed45953af5627c1a5ac09006023f43.poster.avif?t=1750129783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/2bed45953af5627c1a