t's not tied down, so get creative.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/e6b9fc99447e252f3ff0ff216d49bcca.avif?t=1750129783\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fully physics based. Pick up vehicles, enemies, or redirect heat seeking missiles. Discover emergent gameplay. <br></li><li> Full single player campaign <br></li><li> Buy and upgrade helicopters <br></li><li> Customizable loadouts<br></li><li> 3 biomes: Desert, Jungle, Arctic <br></li><li> Day and night missions<br></li><li> Wide range of physics based enemy vehicles: tanks, jeeps, technicals, anti-air turrets, boats, and fighter jets</li></ul><br><strong>Don't forget to wishlist and follow!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1750129783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710820/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1750129783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></strong>",
